    "text": "<p><img height=\"258\" src=\"assets\\st0136_f459203bd544.png\" width=\"317\" /></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> be electric field in air</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Tsin&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>qE</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Tcos&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>mg</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>qE</mi><mi>mg</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0136_268531abdd17.png\" style=\"width: 329px; height: 128px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mi>Ïµ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mi>Ïµ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Ïµ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&rArr;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&middot;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mi>mg</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi>mg</mi></mfrac><mo>&times;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub>